        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1555, Flush Bolt For Hollow Metal Door</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe UL Listed Commercial Flush Bolt for Hollow Metal Doors is used to secure the inactive door on a set of double doors no matter if the active door is open or closed. When the inactive door is closed, moving the lock lever up locks it and moving the lever down unlocks it. This flush bolt has a 12 inch extension with a 1-1/2 inch adjustable bolt head.  12\" Flush Bolt is for for use on metal fire doors up to 4 feet x 8 feet for up to 3 hours. It comes packaged with installation hardware, guide plate, and strike.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1555_size.gif?v=1704354586\" width=\"600\" height=\"280\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1555 flush bolt size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCross Reference--The Don-Jo 1555 Flush Bolt can be used in place of the following: Ives FB458, ABH 1855S, Hager 282D, Trimco 3917, Rockwood 555, and Global TH1100-FBUL.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Don-Jo 1555 Hollow Metal Door Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI 156.16. UL Listed F for use on metal fire doors up to 4'0\" x 8'0\" for up to 3 hours.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with Strike and guide plates</li>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" adjustable bolt head.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 1555 Hollow Metal Door Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 5-7/32\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Flush Bolt Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Extention Rod: 10-1/2\" Length, 1/4-20 Thread</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Adjustment: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>5/8\" adjustment on rod length</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate: 2-1/4\"  x 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Plate: 2\"  x 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screws: 4 ea. #8 x 1-1/2\" Combo Screw, 4 ea. #8 x 3/4\" Combo Screw</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed F 5RB4</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1555.pdf?v=1704262382\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1555 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
